          "no": 1,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "***** RETAIL BOOKING COMPLETION NOTES *****\n\nWhere was the booking made: In Store\n\nPassenger has been made aware of the importance of providing a contact number for use in Resort:\n\nMobile contact number in Client ID:\n\nDeparture date:\n\nFFP/FVC in Client ID:\n\n****************************************************\n\nPRE EXISTING MEDICAL CONDITIONS:\nDoes the customer have any pre-existing medical conditions? N\nIf Yes, have you filled out the Accessible Travel Services Form? \n\n****************************************************\n\nNumber of Adults: 2\nNumber of Children \u0026 Ages:\nNumber of Infants \u0026 Ages:\n\n* FLIGHTS *\n\nDepart London Heathrow Sun 15 Nov 2026 11:45 Cabin PREMIUM VS 214 ( Operated by Virgin Atlantic )\nArrival Phuket Airport Mon 16 Nov 2026 06:55\n\nDepart Phuket Airport Sat 28 Nov 2026 09:20 Cabin UPPER CLASS VS 215 ( Operated by Virgin Atlantic )\nArrival London Heathrow Sat 28 Nov 2026 16:00\n\nFlight Dates:\nFlight Times:\nClass: premium/ upper class\n\n\nHas the airlines seat booking policy been discussed? booked\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* HOTELS / VILLAS *  \n\nHotel: Khaolak Merlin Resort\n\n\nROOM TYPE \u2013 *If bed requirements are different to standard please detail what you have done to confirm this and is customer aware? -\n\nDeluxe Room Double (Deluxe Room Double) 1Room\n\n\nBOARD BASIS - half board plus\n\nON REQUEST, has the process been advised?\n\nSPECIAL REQUEST, is your request possible in your hotel, i.e. is bedding correct for the room type booked?\n\nHave Resort Fees, Local Fees and Taxes been advised?\n\n*****************************************************\n\n*RESORT TRANSFERS* \n\nreturn private transfers\n\nPax weight for helicopter transfer:\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* CAR HIRE *\n\nBooked for full duration?\nIf not what are other arrangements?\n\nIs pick up time 2 after landing and drop off 3 hours before departure?\n\nDoes the car pick up and drop off at the correct locations?\n\nIs car size adequate for party?\n\nCar Insurance type?\n\nIf basic package what is the reason?\n\nIs anyone under 25 driving without Gold Plus insurance aware additional cost in resort when collecting car?\n\nHave one way drop off fees been advised?\n\n******************************************************\n\nEXCURSIONS / EXTRAS / V-ROOM / VIRGIN EXPERIENCES\nIf not booked for all pax, what is the reason?\nHelicopter experience - passenger weight:\n\n\n******************************************************\nT-BOX RE-CAP\nApplicable errata\u2019s advised: y\nNames checked phonetically : y\nItinerary recapped to pax: y\n\n******************************************************\nTOTAL COST  \u00A37997.55\nFinal cost agreed including cc charge if applicable:\nDiscount used (not applicable to OODR bookings):\n\n******************************************************\nDEPOSIT \u00A3200\nVHols standard deposit:\nPublished fare in full:\nApplicable hotel/experience charges:\nHas full deposit been taken? if no please explain why:\n\nLOW DEPOSIT\nDeposit amount taken (\u00A375pp plus \u00A325 booking fee):\nUpfront charges taken (e.g. Hotel / 20 % of Tour / Published Fare / Experience / Wedding Deposit):\nIf low deposit is lower than \u00A375pp please explain why \u0026 who authorised this:\nHas a Direct Debit been set up?\nHas the Low Deposit generic item been added?\n***************************************************\nDate remaining deposit amount to be collected:\n***************************************************\nHas this date been put in the Store diary?\n\n***************************************************\n\nItinerary recapped to pax ensuring dates and hotel / transfers match: Y or N\n\nHave you advised the passenger to check the FCO website? Y or N\n\nHave you advised the passengers of any VISA or ESTA requirements if applicable? Y or N\n\nData protection advised: Y or N\n\n*Password* for other passengers:",
