          "code": "Thailand - Alcohol Restrictions",
          "description": "Thailand - Alcohol Restrictions",
          "note": "The sale and service of alcohol may be restricted due to Buddhist holidays. \n\nThe five major Buddhist holidays are Makha Bucha Day (3rd March 2026, 21st \nFebruary 2027), Visakha Bucha Day (31st May 2026, 20th May 2027), Asalha \nBucha Day (10th July 2025, 29th July 2026, 18th July 2027), Buddhist Lent \nDay - Khao Phansa (30th July 2026, 20 July 2027) and End of Buddhist Lent - \nOk Phansa (7th October 2025, 26th October 2026). \n\nDates are based on the lunar calendar and may be subject to change without \nnotice.",
