          "code": "Thailand - Pre departure Overnight Stay",
          "description": "Thailand - Pre departure Overnight Stay",
          "note": "Please note: When travelling with Virgin Atlantic to Phuket, due to the flight \ndeparture time, accommodation requiring a long transfer and/or a boat transfer \n(for example islands such as Phi Phi, Koh Yao, Koh Yao Noi, Koh Samui, \nHua Hin and Bangkok etc.) will not be suitable on the final night. \nCustomers should stay overnight on the mainland or closer to the airport \nprior to departure to ensure they are able to make their flight.\n\nWe also strongly recommend against spending your final night in Krabi, \ndue to the long transfer time required to make your return flight home with \nVirgin Atlantic. For a seamless transfer, we recommend staying in Phuket or\nKhao Lak for at least 1 night prior to departure.",
          "dateModified": "2026-01-13T11:33:39",
          "external": true,
          "internal": true,
          "priority": "H",
          "itemInfo": [
            "FLT 1",
            "HTL 1",
            "TRS 1",
